   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "You can keep your existing URL, which will automatically redirect to Statshub. The redirect to the new URL and the solution will be handled by Sportradar, so there is no need to change or implement anything on your side. How will URL change?: *s5.sir.sportradar.com/{alias}* → redirect to *statshub.sportradar.com/{alias}* Will there be a downtime?: No downtime expected. Migration will be handled seamlessly by Sportradar.",
