   "id": "docs-readme-frequently-asked-questions-how-do-i-set-up-the-solution-in-the-iframe",
   "question": "Frequently Asked Questions — How do I set up the solution in the iFrame?",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "The desktop version of the solution allows for iFrame implementation within a container with a set height. If the content or scoreboard exceeds the height of the container, a scrollbar will appear inside the container. The solution is responsive and will adapt to any width up to 375 pixels without losing functionality. In this case, you also need to provide the domain to be whitelisted to [bet-integrations@sportradar.com](mailto:integrations@sportradar.com).",
