   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "A custom adapter implementation that you develop yourself. This gives you complete control over: * Data fetching and updating logic * Caching strategies * Transformation rules **Use when:** * You want full control over implementation * You're not using one of supported data provider [Learn more about Self-Service Implementation →](/engagement-tools/adapter/self-service-implementation.md)",
   "product": null,
   "entities": [],
   "source": "docs",
   "pageTitle": "Overview",
