   "href": "https://developer.sportradar.com/getting-started/docs/get-started#httpsfilesreadmeiob14463c22b4f5b3781ff21ada973ad95917c87dc49e366f66453b05de42d3e6c-variousproductswidgetsgearsvg-league-specific-general-sport-apis",
