   "question": "Versioning — How often do you version up your APIs?",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "We aim to version up an API only when necessary due to a breaking change. Most API versions will be supported for multiple years. However, new features and releases are typically only added to the latest version of an API. <br /> How does Sportradar notify customers when a new version is released?: When releasing a new version, we send a product announcement to the email associated with your account. <br />",
