   "id": "docs-docs-id-types-id-types",
   "question": "ID Types",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Within Sportradar APIs you will encounter many different ID values. IDs can be attributed to leagues, conferences, divisions, franchises, teams, venues, drafts, weeks, periods, quarters, coaches, managers, prospects, draft picks, trades, transactions, drives, possessions, plays, in-game events, and many other variables. To translate IDs between Sportradar's ID systems or link them to external provider IDs, use the Mapping API. <br /> ***",
