   "id": "docs-docs-simulations-make-an-api-request",
   "question": "Simulations — Make an API Request",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Use your `recordingId` and `sessionId` to make a request for a game. Continually request this path to receive updates. Click [here](https://developer.sportradar.com/getting-started/docs/simulations#restful-request-path) for the complete path parameters. ```curl curl --location --request GET 'https://playback.sportradar.com/replay/nfl/95aa13a0-6538-11ef-9287-d597687b4672?feed=boxscore&contentType=json&sessionId={sessionId}' ``` *** RESTful Request Path: `https://playback.sportradar.com/replay/{sportradar_api}/{recordingId}?feed={feed}&contentType={contentType}&sessionId={sessionId}`",
