   "id": "docs-docs-mcp-server-before-you-begin",
   "question": "MCP Server — Before You Begin",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "The Sportradar requires a valid Sportradar API key. If you don't already have one, you can create a free trial through the Sportradar Marketplace: 1. Visit the Sportradar Marketplace and register for an account. 2. Browse by sport, league, or product type and select a product to start a free 30-day trial. 3. Once your trial is approved, copy your API key from your Marketplace account — you'll use it in the MCP client configuration below. <br /> ***",
