   "id": "docs-resources-virtual-stadium-features",
   "question": "Virtual Stadium — Features:",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Match and tournament level chat rooms where bettors can interact and form communities. Comprehensive betting tools such as Bet Sharing, Bet Copying and Flash bets generated by live match events. Live action visualization via Live Channel Online streams and Live Match Tracker. VIP chat which gives users the opportunity to interact with influencers and VIPs. AI assisted moderation tools such as Copilot, Autopilot, anti-spamming and blacklisted words that provide a simple way of moderating hundreds of channels. Roles and permission based moderation system. Extensive analytics tools. Web Integration: Embed Virtual Stadium in your website as a popup or inline widget. Android Integration: Add native Android components to your app with customizable styles. iOS Integration: Integrate native iOS components with flexible customization options. SDK Integration: Build custom UI components with complete control using our Data SDK. To optimize time to production, web widget integration, adapter development, and multiple platform integrations can progress in parallel once the first two phases are complete.",
   "product": "Virtual Stadium",
