   "answer": "Responsive Design: Widget automatically adjusts at 310px, 420px, and 560px widths. Consider layout: \"single\" for mobile (< 768px). Collapse to LMT Compact: Live Match Tracker can be presented as a full version (LMT Plus) or as a compact version (LMT Compact). LMT Compact allows basic match action to remain visible while users scroll through the rest of content.",
