   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Property Type Default Description matchId number Required The unique identifier for the match. See Getting Identifiers disableWidgetHeader boolean true When true, hides the widget header and match info disablePitch false When true, hides pitch visualization. Forces layout to \"single\" layout string \"single\" \"single\": Vertical layout with tabbed content \"double\": Split view with pitch and statistics side-by-side \"topdown\": Full-width stacked layout with collapsible sections disableComponents When true, hides all tab components (statistics, timeline, etc.) momentum \"compact\" \"bars\": Simple bar chart \"compact\": Condensed momentum display \"extended\": Detailed momentum with line chart \"disable\": Hide momentum scoreboard \"compact\": Minimal scoreboard with essential info \"extended\": Detailed scoreboard with additional context \"disable\": Hide scoreboard scoreboardLargeJerseys When true, displays larger team jersey graphics in scoreboard collapseTo \"disable\" \"disable\": No collapsing \"scoreboard\": Collapse to scoreboard only \"momentum\": Collapse to scoreboard + momentum \"pitch\": Collapse to scoreboard + pitch (topdown layout only) expanded Initial expand state when collapseTo is enabled.",
