   "answer": "Pitch Customisation Video Streaming (LCO) Video Highlight (LCP) Virtualised LMT Property Type Default Description disablePitchNoise boolean false When true, removes noise texture from pitch surface disablePitchStripes When true, removes grass stripes or field markings disablePitchOverlay When true, removes an overlay that highlights the pitch by adding slight dim to the borders of the pitch disablePitchSpotlights When true, removes spotlight effects from pitch pitchBgImage string - Custom background image URL for pitch. Overrides default pitch surface pitchCustomBgColor Custom pitch background color (hex/rgb). Example: \"#1a5f3e\" customBrandColor Primary brand color for accents and theming (hex/rgb) pitchBrandBgColor When true, uses customBrandColor as pitch background pitchLightStyle When true, uses light-colored pitch theme with dark lines pitchLogo URL of logo to display on pitch surface pitchLogoForceCenter When true, positiones the pitch logo to the center of the pitch for basketball, tennis, ice hockey, handball, snooker, kabbadi, volleyball, beach volleyball and badminton.",
