   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Live video for Golf is available only with Premium LMT Feature. When is enabled, if the currently displayed hole has available, a button or a tab will be shown, based on the value of streamToggle prop. Clicking them opens a stream overlay with the standard LMT video player on top of the golf content. When streams are available, the hole selection UI is also shown on the Live tab and at the top level of the Courses tab. To enable streaming: Pass a jwt prop with \"av\" scope. See JWT Authentication. Pass a streamToggle prop, e.g. onPitchButton. Ensure stream availability is not suppressed by streamNotAvailableMessage or streamNotAvailableBgImage. Use the streaming-related properties in the table above to configure player behaviour (streamAutoplay, streamMuteVideo, and others).",
