   "answer": "The widget can be embedded inline (always visible) or as a button that opens a pop-up overlay. Inline Button (Pop-up) Always-visible insights displayed directly on the page — ideal for dedicated betting sections. { integration: \"inline\" } Widget Title: The title in the widget header (or button label) can include or hide its icon. With Icon (Default) Without Icon { widgetTitle: \"Bet Insights\" } Card Variants: Controls the visual style of each insight card. Default Default with Icon Compact Button Button Footer Standard card with market name and outcome information. { cardVariant: \"default\" }",
