   "id": "docs-bet-insights-bet-insights-advanced-format-with-specifiers",
   "question": "Bet Insights — Advanced format with specifiers",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "When you need to test specific specifier values (or multiple values for the same market), use the advanced string format: marketId1;specifier1,specifier2|marketId2;specifier1,specifier2 Delimiters: Delimiter Purpose | Separates multiple market configurations ; Separates market ID from its specifier sets , Separates multiple specifier sets for one market & Separates multiple specifiers within the same set (for markets that use more than one specifier)",
