   "question": "Player Prop Zone — What it looks like",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "The widget shows team selection at the top, primary prop categories, secondary filters where applicable, and a sport-specific pitch or court view with players and their odds. Locked or unavailable outcomes are indicated with a lock icon. For combined markets, the pitch switches to a dual-player layout with a pair selector, combined progress toward the line, a line stepper, and Over / Under odds. For player vs player markets, the pitch shows the two selected players head-to-head with a VS indicator.",
