   "id": "docs-match-player-prop-zone-key-capabilities",
   "question": "Player Prop Zone — Key capabilities",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Sport-specific markets: and each expose their own tab set for the same widget (match.playerPropZone). Tabbed markets: Navigate player prop markets by category (for example goalscorers, cards, and shots in soccer; points, rebounds, and assists in basketball). Dual-player markets (basketball): Combined player totals and player-vs-player markets use a dedicated pair selector and pitch layouts (combined progress + Over/Under, or head-to-head VS). Configurable tabs: Restrict or reorder tabs via includedTabs, excludedTabs, and tabOrder. Label overrides: Customize tab and secondary tab labels with labelOverrides. Bet slip integration: Receive selection data via onAction and sync bet slip state via the adapter (see Bet slip integration). Theming: Customize appearance via CSS classes (see customization).",
