   "answer": "CSS class Supported CSS properties srct-br-footer color srct-br-loading background-color, border-radius srct-br-outcome background-color, color, border-radius srct-br-outcome--selected srct-br-outcome--disabled srct-br-outcome--unavailable srct-br-outcome__name font-size, color srct-br-outcome__value srct-br-eventinfo srct-br-eventinfo__info font-size srct-br-eventinfo__icon srct-br-eventinfo__time srct-br-eventinfo__status srct-br-eventinfo__name srct-br-scoreboard srct-br-scoreboard__teams srct-br-scoreboard__scores srct-br-scoreboard__score-1 srct-br-scoreboard__score-2 srct-br-scoreboard__score-3 srct-br-market__name srct-br-market__type srct-br-market__more-markets srct-br-eventcard background, color srct-br-leagueinfo background, font-size, color, border srct-br-leagueinfo__info srct-br-leagueinfo__icon srct-br-table__content background-color srct-br-table__header font-size, color, background-color srct-br-table__subheader srct-br-table__cell border srct-br-table__row-spacing width Integration: Mandatory Configuration The filters property is required for this widget to function correctly. It defines the recommendation logic and basic data constraints.",
