   "answer": "The following are provided by the adapter and are also available in the callback payload. Event Property Type Required Description id string | number Yes Sportradar event ID. externalId — Client-side event ID. date string Formatted date string displayed in the widget. sport.id Sport ID. Use sportsMapping if not using Sportradar sport IDs. sport.name Sport name. category.id Category ID. category.name Category name (e.g. \"England\"). tournament.id Tournament/league ID. tournament.name Tournament name. teams Array<{id, name}> Home and away competitors. isLive boolean Whether the event is currently live. liveCurrentTime Live time display (e.g. \"2nd set\", \"45'\"). result1 / result2 / result3 result Score columns: { result: [homeScore, awayScore] }. Market Market ID. name Market name (e.g. \"Match Winner\"). status.isActive When false, see Widget Behavior. Outcome Outcome ID. Outcome name (e.g. \"Home\", \"Draw\"). odds Odds value. Use a number type to enable odds-change indicators (up/down arrows). specifier.value Additional specifier (e.g. handicap value \"-2.50\"). Tips: With cardsLayout: \"horizontal\", visible cards = cards per row × maxRows.",
