   "id": "docs-bet-recommendation-leagues-tips",
   "question": "Leagues — Tips",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "When two share the same name (e.g. both called \"Premier League\"), the widget automatically adds country disambiguation labels even when labelType is set to \"hidden\". Avoid these redundant icon/label combinations: iconType: \"sport\" with labelType: \"sport\", and iconType: \"flag\" with labelType: \"country\". If activeTournamentId does not match any league in the current recommendations, no tab is highlighted — this is expected behavior, not an error.",
