   "id": "docs-docs-client-configuration-guide-pinning-the-match",
   "question": "Client Configuration Guide — Pinning the match",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Description Users can save specific matches by pinning them (using the pin icon available on each match) so they can access them later without searching. When a match is pinned, users can also set reminders. These reminders can be as simple as a notification when the match starts, or more advanced options such as betting-related alerts (e.g., \"Goals over X.5\"). Pinned matches are displayed in both the and the Favourites page. Reminders are delivered as notification pop-ups. Users can mute them at any time from the settings menu. Technical Note Configurable options (adjustable from default): Remove the possibility of pinning the match. Remove the possibility to add reminders (only is possible). Visual example",
