   "id": "docs-docs-client-configuration-guide-odds-markets",
   "question": "Client Configuration Guide — Odds & Markets",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Description By default, StatsHub displays simple 2-way or 3-way markets for each match. Markets are available pre-match, live, and post-match, with historical odds accessible for up to one year after the match has ended. Clients can integrate their own odds, or StatsHub will display generic odds. Users can click on a specific market to be redirected either to the bookmaker's betting site or directly to the betslip. Technical Note Configurable options (adjustable from default): Display markets and odds (3-way, 2-way) Bookmaker's site Bookmaker's betslip Show markets with odds without the links Page Views Tracking:",
