   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Description StatsHub works seamlessly on betting terminals. It can be configured to display a single page—most commonly the \"Overview\" subpage within the H2H—while disabling all other navigation options. We have two distinct modes available for betting terminals: full terminal - which removes all navigation and nothing on page is clickable semi-terminal - the user can interact with the page, but navigation to other matches, tournaments etc. is disabled. Technical Note Configurable options (adjustable from default): Enable \"betting terminals\" product version Show \"Overview\" or \"Match Report\" or \"Statistics. Visual example Super Logo on page Full-width content with Filters in the",
