   "question": "Deeplinks — URL Format",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "https://statshub.sportradar.com/{clientAlias}/{language}/entity/{entityId} Part Description {clientAlias} Your client alias (e.g. sportradar) {language} Language code (e.g. en, de, es) {entityId} Sportradar entity ID in the format sr:{type}:{id} Entity ID Format: Entity IDs follow the standard Sportradar format: sr:{type}:{id} For example: sr:match:61301091, sr:tournament:17, sr:player:991181. Supported Entity Types: match: Links directly to a page. Entity ID: sr:match:{id} Example: /sportradar/en/entity/sr:match:61301091",
