   "answer": "Links to a landing page. The behavior depends on whether the is a stage-based (e.g. motorsport, cycling) or a match-based (e.g. football, basketball). Entity ID: sr:sport:{id} Query parameters for match-based sports: Parameter Type Required Description date string No Filter matches by date status live | all Filter by status Query parameters for stage-based sports: categoryId ID to display seasonId ID to display Filter by date Examples: /sportradar/en/entity/sr:sport:1 /sportradar/en/entity/sr:sport:1?status=live /sportradar/en/entity/sr:sport:40?categoryId=36&seasonId=1285547",
