   "answer": "Your customized StatsHub application is accessible via a unique URL configured by the Sportradar integration team. The standard URL format is: https://statshub.sportradar.com/{client_alias}/{language} client_alias: Your unique bookmaker/media identifier (provided during setup). language: The localized display language (e.g., en, de). StatsHub natively supports over 40 languages. Example Baseline URL: https://statshub.sportradar.com/sportradar/en",
