   "id": "docs-docs-iframe-modal-integration-guide-basic-iframe-implementation",
   "question": "iFrame/Modal integration Guide — Basic iFrame Implementation",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "To display the StatsHub module directly within your container page, place the following <iframe> block inside your HTML: <div class=\"statshub-container\"> <iframe id=\"statsIframe\" src=\"https://statshub.sportradar.com/{your_alias}/{language}/sport/1\" scrolling=\"yes\" style=\"width: 100%; border: none;\"> </iframe> </div>",
