   "question": "Overview — Backend Automation",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "For production environments, consider implementing a backend solution to automate channel creation. Common approaches include creating channels ahead of time using scheduled jobs (e.g., cron jobs before matches begin) or generating them on-demand when users first access a match or event. Automating channel creation helps maintain consistency and reduces manual overhead as you scale. Automate channel creation using the REST API endpoints. Learn how to obtain Sportradar entity IDs (srEntityId) needed for channel creation.",
