   "id": "docs-gettingstarted-overview-phase-4-integration",
   "question": "Overview — Phase 4: Integration",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "After completing the post-kickoff setup, you can proceed with your platform-specific integration: Web Integration: Embed Virtual Stadium in your website as a popup or inline widget. Android Integration: Add native Android components to your app with customizable styles. iOS Integration: Integrate native iOS components with flexible customization options. SDK Integration: Build custom UI components with complete control using our Data SDK. To optimize time to production, web widget integration, adapter development, and multiple platform integrations can progress in parallel once the first two phases are complete. Integration Timeline",
