   "answer": "This guide explains how to host Sportradar web widgets inside a native Android app using Jetpack Compose and WebView. The integration pattern is reusable for all widgets. The only widget-specific parts are: the widget name passed to SIR(\"addWidget\", ...) the props object passed to that widget optional loader options (language, theme, adapters, and similar) optional JavaScript callbacks such as onTrack or onItemClick Follow the Sportradar web / JavaScript widget documentation for the loader bootstrap and SIR(\"addWidget\", ...) call. On Android, host that page with a shared WebView, which provides layout helpers and JavaScript communication.",
