   "question": "Android Native Integration for Web Widgets — Goals",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "By completing this tutorial, you will: Build a reusable Compose host around WebView Load Sportradar widget HTML with the correct base URL so assets resolve Bridge JavaScript -> Kotlin messages for height and widget callbacks Bridge Android -> JavaScript so you can call SIR(...) without reloading Size the WebView to the widget's content height inside native scroll containers Swap widgets by changing HTML / props only, not the native host",
