   "answer": "When providing SVG files or inline SVG, ensure: Root element has id=\"icon\" (for some widget types) <svg id=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"> <!-- icon paths --> </svg> Proper viewBox for scaling No hardcoded colors if you want CSS theming to apply Always test custom icons in different widget states (active, inactive, hover) to ensure proper visibility against various backgrounds.",
