   "id": "docs-tutorials-handling-selections-and-odds-scope-which-widgets-this-applies-to",
   "question": "Handling Selections and Odds — Scope: which widgets this applies to",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Any widget that pushes a selection into a bet slip follows the same principles, regardless of the callback name: Bet Insights and Tournament Bet Insights — onItemClick Bet Recommendation (Event List, Highlights, Leagues, Markets, My Combo, Swipe Bet) — onItemClick Bet Concierge — onAction BET 3-in-1 — onAction / onItemClick (delegates to the composed widgets) Player Prop Zone — onItemClick Custom Bet — Data Adapter addToBetSlip",
