   "question": "Error Handling Approaches",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "There are two main approaches to handling widget errors: using the silent property for simple error suppression, or implementing custom logic with the onTrack callback for more sophisticated error handling.",
   "product": null,
