   "answer": "Name Type Attributes Description method 'addWidget' <required> Method name. domElOrSelector string | DomElement Widget DOM element or selector. For widget integrations within ShadowDOM, shadowDOM mutation observer example. name string Widget name. props object Widget configuration properties. See sub-properties below. props sub-properties: silent boolean When true, suppresses widget error displays. onTrack function Event tracking callback. See Event Tracking Guide for details. widgetProps * <repeatable> Additional widget-specific properties passed through to the widget. callback Triggered only once, when widget is rendered (does not trigger on widget changes due to user action or async data loading.) updateWidget: Updates a widget on given DOM element or selector.",
