   "answer": "a signed JWT token string that can be used to authenticate with Sportradar widgets and products. Generate tokens server-side only Create unique tokens for each user session Never share tokens between users Tokens are valid for 16 hours maximum (or until exp if specified) Shorter token lifespans improve security Node.js Python Java C# Sign JWT Token: import jwt from \"jsonwebtoken\"; import fs from \"fs\"; // Load private key const privateKey = fs.readFileSync(\"rsa-private.pem\", \"utf8\"); // Create token with base + Virtual Stadium claims const token = jwt.sign( { iss: \"your-organization\", sub: \"user123\", scope: \"vs\", apiKey: \"vs_live_abc123xyz789\", displayName: \"John Doe\", userType: \"Normal\", // iat is added automatically }, privateKey, { algorithm: \"RS256\" }, ); console.log(token); Example Token Output Example With Multiple Scopes (Node.js)",
