   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Users see a blank space while widgets load, which can: Create confusion about whether the page is working Make the page feel slow or broken Reduce user confidence in your integration A loading indicator provides visual feedback that content is on the way. Tutorial Steps:",
