   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Symptom: The toggle button shows up, but clicking it doesn't display the widget. Cause: The widget wasn't properly moved from the loading area. Solution: Verify the DOM manipulation in your onTrack callback: // Check in browser console console.log('Widget parent:', widget.parentElement); // Should show #your-content, not #loading-area",
