   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Property Type Required Default Description isInline boolean No false false: Renders as button that opens overlay modal true: Renders inline without button or overlay buttonTitle string 'Custom Bet' Text displayed on the button in overlay mode. Ignored when isInline is true buttonIcon - URL of icon image to display next to button text. Ignored when isInline is true productTitle Title displayed in widget header. Customizes the branding of the bet builder overlayWidth number 720 Width of overlay modal in pixels when isInline is false. overlayParent string | function document.body Parent container for overlay modal. Can be CSS selector string or function returning HTMLElement. Useful for containing overlay within specific page sections isDialogInFullScreen CustomBet widget overlay takes up full viewport width and height. Enable full-screen mode for overlay on mobile devices. Only to be used when isInline is set to false.",
