   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "UOF API Key → To access the API you must visit Betradar and generate an application key associated with Betradar user details. This API key has to be sent as an HTTP header on every request towards the service. Store account → Sales need to submit a trial request through a customer account in Salesforce with all required products, sports, tournaments, and domains. After that, Jira issue will be generated, and order can be created.",
