   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Collection of functions used for communication between the widget and client code. The widget calls these functions every 30 seconds to refresh data. Property Type Description Fetches fixture data from Fixture API Fetches market descriptions from Markets API Calculates odds from API Fetches available selections from Available Selections API Fetches competitor profile from Competitor Profile API addToBetSlip Called when the user clicks \"Add to bet slip\" button Types:",
