   "id": "docs-integration-uof-proxy-uofdataprovidercallback",
   "question": "UOF Proxy — UOFDataProviderCallback",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Callback function shared by all data provider functions. Pass UOF XML response as a string. Parameter Type Description error CBError | string | undefined Error object, or false on success data string Forwarded UOF XML data as string Example: // Success callback(false, xmlString); // Error callback({ type: 1, message: \"Could not fetch data\" });",
