   "question": "Head to Head Custom Components Order — Simplified Notation",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "of simplified notation: components: [\"headtohead\", \"form\", \"teamstats\", \"lastmatches\"]. Manipulating this array enables you to: re-order components by changing the order of strings in the array, disable components by removing specific strings from the array.",
   "product": null,
