   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "An adapter is a piece of code that acts as a bridge between two systems. In the context of Bet Suggestions, an adapter connects your data source (such as a backend API or database) to the Suggested Bets feature in the Bet Concierge displayed to users. For more general information about Sportradar adapters see Adapter Overview.",
