   "id": "docs-bet-concierge-api-and-examples-api-reference",
   "question": "Bet Concierge API Reference and Examples — API Reference",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Property Type Required Default Description entityId string Yes - Sportradar entity identifier in sr:match:{id} format (e.g., \"sr:match:50955863\"). See Getting Identifiers. getJwt Callback that returns the user's JWT for authentication. Called on widget init and when a token refresh is needed. See getJwt(). enableCustomBet boolean No false Set this prop to true when implementing Custom Bet feature. This will enable calculateCustomBetXML adapter call. isInline When true, enables inline mode without close button. globeIconStyle \"light\" | \"dark\" \"light\" Visual style for the globe icon: \"light\" for light backgrounds, \"dark\" for dark backgrounds. isRelativeScoreboardDateFormat true When true, scoreboard dates use relative formatting; when false, absolute dates. onAction function callback Optional callback invoked when the widget needs your app to react (for example: close or hide the widget, handle errors, or add a selection to the bet slip). See The onAction callback.",
