   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Emitted when the widget reports an error (for example JWT failure). You can use error / details for logging. Property Type Description error string Summary message. details Additional detail. Example payload: { error: \"401 Error when requesting https://sportradar.com/status\", details: \"Client token exception - Invalid token\", }",
