   "id": "docs-bet-concierge-market-mapping-bet-concierge-market-mapping",
   "question": "Bet Concierge Market Mapping",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Bet Concierge AI Bot is designed to work with Sportradar markets. To allow Bet Concierge to suggest accurate and relevant markets using your own data, it's important to map your market IDs with the corresponding Sportradar market IDs. This requirement applies to all markets (and outcomes) sent to Bet Concierge via the widget adapter. The widget expects all market data to follow the Sportradar format. A list of Sportradar market IDs and their corresponding outcome IDs is available on Unified Odds Feed (UOF) docs",
