   "id": "docs-adapter-hostedimplementation-advanced-configuration-and-extensions",
   "question": "Hosted Adapter — Advanced Configuration and Extensions",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "The provides sensible defaults for most integrations, but you can extend its functionality or override behavior by providing a partial adapter object as an optional third parameter to the SIR(\"registerAdapter\", ...) call. This hybrid approach offers the reliability of a Sportradar-managed solution alongside the flexibility of local customization.",
