   "answer": "/* Basic tab styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab { background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #333; } /* Active tab styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab--active { background-color: #ffffff; color: #1d4ed8; } /* Tab indicator styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab__indicator--active { background-color: #1d4ed8; } /* Icon styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab__icon { color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffffff; } All widget styles must be scoped within the .sr-bb container class to ensure proper isolation and prevent conflicts with your site's CSS. Available Tabs by Widget: Different widgets use different sets of tabs. Below is a reference of which tab IDs are available for each widget type.",
