   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Create your HTML file with the widget container and necessary styling: <!DOCTYPE html> <html> <head> <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" /> <title>Match Preview Tabs Configuration</title> <style> .sr-widgets { background: #001212; color: #ffffff; } /* Custom tab styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab { background: #ac1a2f; color: #ffffff; } /* Active tab styling */ .sr-bb .srct-tab--active { background: #ffffff; color: #ac1a2f; } /* Hover effect */ .sr-bb .srct-tab:hover { background: #8d1526; } .sr-bb .srct-tab--active:hover { background: #ffffff; } </style> </head> <body> <!-- Widget container --> <div class=\"sr-widgets\"> <div class=\"sr-widget sr-widget-1\"></div> </div> <!-- Widget script will go here --> </body> </html>",
