   "id": "docs-examples-customizing-tabs-configuration-breakdown",
   "question": "Customizing Widget Tabs — Configuration Breakdown",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Display Options: option: 'iconText' - Shows both icons and text labels iconPosition: 'start' - Places icons before text Layout Options: variant: 'standard' - Tabs use minimum width (not full width) align: 'end' - Tabs are right-aligned Styling: useClientTheming: true - Enables custom CSS classes (.srct-*) Custom CSS defines red background for inactive tabs, white for active tabs Custom Icons: icons.avStream - Provides custom icon URL for the stream tab Start with a simple configuration and add customizations incrementally. Test after each change to ensure everything works as expected. Common Customization Scenarios:",
