   "answer": "All required claims combined in a single payload object. Complete JWT Payload: { \"iss\": \"your-organization\", \"sub\": \"user123\", \"scope\": \"vs\", \"iat\": 1681718850, \"exp\": 1681776450, \"apiKey\": \"vs_live_abc123xyz789\", \"displayName\": \"John Doe\", \"userType\": \"Normal\" }",
