   "id": "docs-gettingstarted-authentication-key-rotation",
   "question": "JWT Authentication — Key Rotation",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Rotate signing keys without service interruption: Generate a New Key Pair: Create a new RSA key pair using the same process as Step 1. Submit the Public Key: Send the new public key to your Sportradar representative. Wait for Confirmation: Sportradar adds the new key to your configuration and notifies you. Both old and new keys work during the transition. Switch Your Backend: Start signing with the new private key, then inform Sportradar when migration is complete so the old public key can be removed.",
