   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Add the widget container with visibility: hidden in the inline style. <!-- Widget container with visibility control --> <div id=\"widget\" class=\"sr-widget\" style=\"visibility: hidden\"></div> Using visibility: hidden keeps the element in the DOM and maintains its layout space, unlike display: none.",
