   "answer": "Create a toggle function that switches between visible and hidden states. const widget = document.getElementById('widget'); // Toggle widget visibility without affecting layout const onWidgetToggle = () => { widget.style.visibility = widget.style.visibility === 'hidden' ? 'visible' : 'hidden'; }",
