   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "Add the widget container with display: none in the inline style. <!-- Widget container that collapses when hidden --> <div id=\"widget\" class=\"sr-widget\" style=\"display: none;\"></div> Widgets initialized while display: none may not render correctly. You must trigger a resize event when making them visible.",
