   "answer": "The widget toggles visibility while collapsing/expanding its space: When to use this approach: Accordion interfaces where content should collapse Mobile responsive layouts to save vertical space Dynamic content loading where hidden items shouldn't reserve space Complete Implementation Examples: Approach 1: Preserve Space Approach 2: Collapse Space View Complete HTML",
