   "question": "Widget Rotation and Dynamic Match Switching — How It Works",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "When you call addWidget with the same target element but different configuration (e.g., different matchId), the widget framework: Detects the existing widget in that element Updates the widget with the new configuration Re-renders with the new data Calling addWidget multiple times on the same element updates the widget rather than creating duplicates. Tutorial Steps:",
