   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "CSS Selector DOM Element SIR('removeWidget', '.sr-widget'); Pass a CSS selector string. The framework will find and remove the widget. Always clear intervals before removing widgets to prevent memory leaks and errors from the interval trying to update a non-existent widget. Complete Implementation: View Complete Working Example Advanced Variations:",
