   "id": "docs-custom-views-overview-creating-custom-views",
   "question": "Creating Custom Views",
   "aliases": [],
   "tags": [],
   "answer": "This section provides a simple tutorial on how to create custom views for data adapter integration in the Custom Bet widget. You will learn how to implement the necessary callback functions to customize the display of data within the widget. This section covers various view types including lists, grids, accordions, rows, and tabs, with examples and visual representations of each view. To create custom views for data adapter integration, you need to implement the following functions: - function that provides the OfferingResponse data to the widget. - function that provides the CalculateResponse data to the widget. The main focus of this tutorial is the function (specifically and metaMarkets) as it configures the views in the widget. But function is also needed to display in Custom Bet views.",
